        370980007. Broader rather than exact: 106164003 denotes motor coordination as a function
        observable where ICF b7602 frames coordination of voluntary movements as a body function; the
        target fully contains the source domain but is one level away in model framing. High tier :
        direct term-and-scope match (motor coordination function = coordination of voluntary movements)
