mapping "b7652.1" source="b7652" target="SNOMED_CT:386783003" relationship=partial_overlap {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b7652 SNOMED CT 386783003 5090003 = ICF b7652: the specific function of TICS AND MANNERISMS
        — a multi-part source bundling two distinct involuntary-movement phenomena (motor/vocal tics and
        stylised manneristic movements), a child of b765. No single SNOMED CT concept expresses the
        combination, so the source decomposes into two partial targets. (1) SNOMED CT 386783003 =, active
        RF2 production 20260701 — covers the tic axis only. Partial (moderate): target captures the tic
        component but leaves the mannerism axis uncovered. (2) SNOMED CT 5090003 =, active RF2 production
        20260701 — covers the mannerism axis only. Partial (low): target captures the mannerism
        component but leaves the tic axis uncovered; in SNOMED CT is partly behavioural, so the overlap
        with ICF's involuntary-movement mannerism is looser. Both targets are findings vs the ICF
        function framing, adding a model-framing gap on each. Each target carries its own
        type/confidence; order strongest-first. mapping_type=partial for each.
        """
}
